            <ArticleTitle>Comments on &quot;Coexistence of hidden chaotic attractors in a novel no-equilibrium system&quot; (Nonlinear Dyn, doi:10.1007/s11071-016-3170-x).</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>749-754</MedlinePgn>
